{"seq":3,"slug":"envelope-adsr","title":"ADSR 包络与时间塑形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/oscillators-filters/envelope-adsr","wordCount":1595,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"adsr-包络与时间塑形\">ADSR 包络与时间塑形</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>包络发生器产生随时间演化的控制信号，是合成器&quot;时间塑形&quot;的核心工具。理解它的关键在于几个概念区分：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>四段结构</strong>：ADSR 由 Note On 触发 Attack、Decay，按键期间保持 Sustain，Note Off 后进入 Release。</li>\n<li><strong>时间值与电平值的区别</strong>：A、D、R 是时间量，S 是电平量，这是初学者最常混淆的一点。</li>\n<li><strong>曲线形状影响感知</strong>：人耳对音量是对数感知，指数曲线比线性更&quot;自然&quot;，模拟合成器的包络天然是指数形。</li>\n<li><strong>ADSR 常常不够用</strong>：DADSR、AHDSR、MSEG、Looping 包络通过增加段数与循环能力扩展时间行为。</li>\n<li><strong>包络的价值在于路由</strong>：同一个包络接到 VCA、Filter Cutoff、Pitch 或 PWM，效果截然不同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"包络发生器的基本概念\">包络发生器的基本概念</h2><p>包络发生器（Envelope Generator）产生一个随时间演化的控制信号，用于调制合成器的各种参数（音量、滤波器截止频率、音高等）。最经典的包络形态是 ADSR（Attack-Decay-Sustain-Release）四段式，由 Note On 和 Note Off 事件触发。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ADSR</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>A</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(Attack)</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(Decay)</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mi>S</mi></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(Sustain)</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(Release)</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ADSR}(t) = \\begin{cases} \\frac{t}{A} &amp; 0 \\leq t &lt; A \\quad \\text{(Attack)} \\\\ 1 - (1-S)\\frac{t-A}{D} &amp; A \\leq t &lt; A+D \\quad \\text{(Decay)} \\\\ S &amp; A+D \\leq t &lt; t_{off} \\quad \\text{(Sustain)} \\\\ S \\cdot e^{-(t-t_{off})/R} &amp; t \\geq t_{off} \\quad \\text{(Release)} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ADSR</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:5.76em;vertical-align:-2.63em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.95em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.592em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.45em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8246em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(Attack)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(Decay)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(Sustain)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(Release)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型范围</th>\n<th>控制什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Attack (A)</td>\n<td>从零到最大值的时间</td>\n<td>0.1 ms–10 s</td>\n<td>起音速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decay (D)</td>\n<td>从最大到 Sustain 的时间</td>\n<td>1 ms–20 s</td>\n<td>初始衰减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sustain (S)</td>\n<td>持续按键时的电平</td>\n<td>0–100%</td>\n<td>持续强度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Release (R)</td>\n<td>松键后到零的时间</td>\n<td>1 ms–30 s</td>\n<td>尾音长度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 Sustain 是电平值（不是时间），而 A、D、R 都是时间值。这是初学者常混淆的点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Note On&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Attack&lt;br/&gt;上升到峰值&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Decay&lt;br/&gt;下降到 Sustain&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Sustain&lt;br/&gt;保持电平&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Note Off&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;Release&lt;br/&gt;下降到零&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Note On\"] --&gt; B[\"Attack&lt;br/&gt;上升到峰值\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Decay&lt;br/&gt;下降到 Sustain\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Sustain&lt;br/&gt;保持电平\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Note Off\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"Release&lt;br/&gt;下降到零\"]</pre><h2 id=\"包络曲线形状-线性-vs-指数\">包络曲线形状：线性 vs 指数</h2><p>包络的曲线形状（Curve Shape）对听觉感知影响巨大。线性包络在数学上最简单，但人耳对音量的感知是对数性的——线性上升的音量听起来&quot;先快后慢&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>线性:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{线性:} \\quad y(t) = t/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">线性</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>指数上升:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{指数上升:} \\quad y(t) = 1 - e^{-t/\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">指数上升</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>指数下降:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{指数下降:} \\quad y(t) = e^{-t/\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">指数下降</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>S 形:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{S 形:} \\quad y(t) = \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-k(t - T/2)}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">S </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">形</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1088em;vertical-align:-0.7873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.296em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.814em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7873em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线类型</th>\n<th>数学</th>\n<th>听觉感知</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性上升</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>先快后慢</td>\n<td>音高包络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凸指数上升</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-e^{-t/\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>均匀加速感</td>\n<td>音量 Attack</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凹指数上升</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>慢启动+快冲顶</td>\n<td>Pad 渐入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数衰减</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-t/\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>自然衰减</td>\n<td>鼓/拨弦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性衰减</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-t/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>人工感</td>\n<td>特效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>模拟合成器的包络天然是指数形（由 RC 充放电特性决定）——这也是为什么&quot;模拟感&quot;往往与指数包络联系在一起。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合成器</th>\n<th>包络曲线</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Minimoog</td>\n<td>指数</td>\n<td>自然/快速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ARP 2600</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>精确/可预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prophet-5</td>\n<td>指数</td>\n<td>温暖/有机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DX7</td>\n<td>多级线性</td>\n<td>复杂/可编程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现代数字</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td>曲率可调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 线性[&quot;线性包络&quot;]&#10;        L1[&quot;直线上升&quot;]&#10;        L2[&quot;直线衰减&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 指数[&quot;指数包络&quot;]&#10;        E1[&quot;快起慢顶&lt;br/&gt;凸曲线&quot;]&#10;        E2[&quot;快降慢尾&lt;br/&gt;自然衰减&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 多段[&quot;多段包络&quot;]&#10;        M1[&quot;DADSR&quot;]&#10;        M2[&quot;多斜率自定义&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 线性[\"线性包络\"]\n        L1[\"直线上升\"]\n        L2[\"直线衰减\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 指数[\"指数包络\"]\n        E1[\"快起慢顶&lt;br/&gt;凸曲线\"]\n        E2[\"快降慢尾&lt;br/&gt;自然衰减\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 多段[\"多段包络\"]\n        M1[\"DADSR\"]\n        M2[\"多斜率自定义\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"多段包络与复杂时间行为\">多段包络与复杂时间行为</h2><p>标准 ADSR 对于许多真实乐器的行为来说过于简化。扩展包络类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>段数</th>\n<th>额外能力</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ADSR</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>基础标准</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DADSR</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Delay（延迟启动）</td>\n<td>层叠声音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AHDSR</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Hold（峰值保持）</td>\n<td>打击乐精确控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multi-stage</td>\n<td>6–32</td>\n<td>任意段/循环</td>\n<td>复杂演化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MSEG</td>\n<td>无限</td>\n<td>自由绘制+循环</td>\n<td>现代合成器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Looping Env</td>\n<td>4+</td>\n<td>A/D 或全段循环</td>\n<td>节奏性调制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MSEG（Multi-Segment Envelope Generator）在现代合成器（Serum, Vital, Phase Plant）中已成标配——用户可以绘制任意复杂度的包络曲线，包括循环段（使包络成为复杂 LFO）。</p>\n<p>Looping 包络的妙用：将 Attack-Decay 段设为循环，包络变为一个形状由 A/D/S 控制的&quot;LFO&quot;——但不像 LFO 那样是简单正弦/三角，而是具有 Attack 快慢和 Decay 曲线形状的复杂波形。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Loop period</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Loop period} = A + D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Loop period</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Loop shape</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>A 曲线</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>D 曲线到 S 电平</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Loop shape} = \\text{A 曲线} + \\text{D 曲线到 S 电平}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Loop shape</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">曲线</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">D </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">曲线到</span><span class=\"mord\"> S </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">电平</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"包络作为调制源的应用\">包络作为调制源的应用</h2><p>包络的价值在于它作为调制源被路由到不同目标时产生的效果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标参数</th>\n<th>包络效果</th>\n<th>经典设置</th>\n<th>音色结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VCA (音量)</td>\n<td>响度时间轮廓</td>\n<td>标配</td>\n<td>声音的基本形态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filter Cutoff</td>\n<td>频谱随时间变化</td>\n<td>正向大量</td>\n<td>明亮起音→暗持续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Oscillator Pitch</td>\n<td>音高弯曲</td>\n<td>快 A, 快 D, 小量</td>\n<td>踢鼓起始下落</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PWM (脉宽)</td>\n<td>波形随时间变化</td>\n<td>慢 A, 中 S</td>\n<td>渐变厚实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LFO Depth</td>\n<td>调制深度变化</td>\n<td>慢 A</td>\n<td>延迟颤音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pan</td>\n<td>空间位置变化</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>声像运动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wavetable Pos</td>\n<td>频谱帧变化</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>音色演化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Velocity（力度）调制包络参数是表现力的关键：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Env Amount</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>Amount</mtext><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>Amount</mtext><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Env Amount}(v) = \\text{Amount}_{base} + v \\cdot \\text{Amount}_{vel}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Env Amount</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Amount</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Amount</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>强力度时包络量大（更明亮的瞬态）；弱力度时包络量小（更柔和的起音）。这模拟了真实乐器的行为——用力弹奏时泛音更丰富。</p>\n<h2 id=\"包络与力度-键位的交互\">包络与力度/键位的交互</h2><p>响应性的包络设置需要考虑演奏动态：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>Vel2Attack</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(v) = A_{base} \\cdot (1 - \\text{Vel2Attack} \\cdot v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Vel2Attack</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>力度大时 Attack 更快（弹奏有力时起音更锐利）——这是钢琴和打击乐器的自然行为。</p>\n<p>Key Tracking 对包络时间的影响——模拟真实乐器中高音弦振动衰减更快的物理现象：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(note) = D_{base} \\cdot 2^{-(note - 60) \\cdot KT / 12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>交互参数</th>\n<th>物理对应</th>\n<th>设置方向</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Velocity → Attack</td>\n<td>弹奏力度</td>\n<td>强力=快攻击</td>\n<td>动态表现力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Velocity → Env Amount</td>\n<td>激励能量</td>\n<td>强力=更明亮</td>\n<td>力度响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Key → Decay</td>\n<td>弦长/管长</td>\n<td>高音=快衰减</td>\n<td>自然物理行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Key → Attack</td>\n<td>质量惯性</td>\n<td>高音=快攻击</td>\n<td>小物体响应快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[&quot;MIDI 输入&lt;br/&gt;Note + Velocity&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;包络发生器&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Attack 时间&lt;br/&gt;受 Velocity 影响&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Env Amount&lt;br/&gt;受 Velocity 影响&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;Decay 时间&lt;br/&gt;受 Key 影响&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;最终包络曲线&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;调制目标&lt;br/&gt;VCA/VCF/Pitch/...&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    A[\"MIDI 输入&lt;br/&gt;Note + Velocity\"] --&gt; B[\"包络发生器\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Attack 时间&lt;br/&gt;受 Velocity 影响\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"Env Amount&lt;br/&gt;受 Velocity 影响\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"Decay 时间&lt;br/&gt;受 Key 影响\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"最终包络曲线\"]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[\"调制目标&lt;br/&gt;VCA/VCF/Pitch/...\"]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ADSR 由 Attack、Decay、Sustain、Release 四段构成，其中 A/D/R 是时间量、S 是电平量。</li>\n<li>曲线形状显著影响听感，指数曲线比线性更接近人耳感知，模拟合成器的&quot;自然感&quot;正源于此。</li>\n<li>标准 ADSR 常不够用，DADSR、AHDSR、MSEG 与 Looping 包络扩展了时间行为的复杂度。</li>\n<li>包络的意义在于路由：同一曲线接到音量、Cutoff、Pitch、PWM 会产生完全不同的音色结果。</li>\n<li>Velocity 与 Key Tracking 让包络响应演奏动态，模拟真实乐器&quot;用力弹奏更明亮、高音衰减更快&quot;的物理行为。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ADSR 包络与时间塑形","id":"adsr-包络与时间塑形"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"包络发生器的基本概念","id":"包络发生器的基本概念"},{"level":2,"text":"包络曲线形状：线性 vs 指数","id":"包络曲线形状-线性-vs-指数"},{"level":2,"text":"多段包络与复杂时间行为","id":"多段包络与复杂时间行为"},{"level":2,"text":"包络作为调制源的应用","id":"包络作为调制源的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"包络与力度/键位的交互","id":"包络与力度-键位的交互"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"滤波器类型与共振特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/oscillators-filters/filter-types"},"next":{"title":"LFO 与周期调制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing/lfo-modulation"}}